backgrounds/hero-*.jpg
backgrounds/scene-*.jpg
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Derived from the condition illustrations in:

    Thyraz/weather-forecast-extended
    https://github.com/Thyraz/weather-forecast-extended

Each file was zoomed, re-cropped to this card's aspect ratio, in some cases
mirrored to reposition the sun or moon, and re-encoded as JPEG. The underlying
illustrations are unchanged in substance.

