-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Map tiles (runtime, not redistributed)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The precipitation map draws over Esri "Gray Canvas" basemap tiles, fetched by
the browser at runtime. Forecast data comes from Open-Meteo
(https://open-meteo.com), free for non-commercial use under CC BY 4.0.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Condition glyphs
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

NOT included in this repository. The card fetches them at runtime from
`icons_path`; supply your own set. See the Icons section of the README.
